vice体量大：适配器除启停还亲自枚举Profile并制定连接策略，PhonePolicy已有类似职责；OPP服务同时处理后台传输状态/数据库同步与设备选择UI的触发和全局发送状态。两处是独立职责面。它们仍有可识别的围绕适配器/传输的边界，不能把所有事件协调当上帝类。","evidence":[{"claim":"公共基类只规定Binder初始化和服务启停钩子，Profile业务实现由子类持有。","commit":"de95b814d40d093d26cd89e910299baee2b5dc31","end_line":109,"evidence_type":"code","independent_group":"profile-lifecycle","path":"src/com/android/bluetooth/btservice/ProfileService.java","source":"repository","source_sha256":"07a62813cd7784dba450936a649f61e2cde6eabf9b7c5e992f1dcdd36abaf833","start_line":79,"symbol":"initBinder"},{"claim":"生产启动真实创建并启动AdvertiseManager、ScanManager、PeriodicScanManager，证明低功耗子职责已拆分。","commit":"de95b814d40d093d26cd89e910299baee2b5dc31","end_line":278,"evidence_type":"code","independent_group":"gatt-management","path":"src/com/android/bluetooth/gatt/GattService.java","source":"repository","source_sha256":"2fe186e1d8604eaf2220a51ad805ddbb33a15af20f77f09829a921a606300461","start_line":249,"symbol":"start"},{"claim":"媒体更新、播放器根和目录查询有独立回调职责。","commit":"de95b814d40d093d26cd89e910299baee2b5dc31","end_line":122,"evidence_type":"code","independent_group":"media-browsing","path":"src/com/android/bluetooth/audio_util/MediaPlayerList.java","source":"repository","source_sha256":"764c88b44f95116fe461e24992fa3966a2f1e8bef7f29c823028217f3003a22e","start_line":111,"symbol":"MediaUpdateCallback"},{"claim":"AVRCP实际把播放器根和目录读取转交MediaPlayerList，不只是未用接口。","commit":"de95b814d40d093d26cd89e910299baee2b5dc31","end_line":435,"evidence_type":"code","independent_group":"media-browsing","path":"src/com/android/bluetooth/avrcp/AvrcpTargetService.java","source":"repository","source_sha256":"ddc84b4adbd14e2c67d9d00d798d7448f00ef218f8e5ea7ca6be74945c929bae","start_line":429,"symbol":"getFolderItems"},{"claim":"适配器核心除启停还针对各Profile逐个设置连接策略。","commit":"de95b814d40d093d26cd89e910299baee2b5dc31","end_line":2946,"evidence_type":"code","independent_group":"adapter-connection-policy","path":"src/com/android/bluetooth/btservice/AdapterService.java","source":"repository","source